          "title": "You'll want to know: دیدگاه",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دیدگاه (didgâh) — \"a point of view, a viewpoint\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "از دیدگاه پدرم، این کار خطرناک است. az didgâh-e pedaram, in kâr khatarnâk ast. From my father's point of view, this is dangerous."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Az didgâh-e … — from the point of view of …. Plural didgâhhâ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "دیدگاه (didgâh) is a native Persian compound built from did \"sight\", the past stem of didan \"to see\", and -gâh \"place\". A point of view is the place you look from."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
