          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "معتقد بودن (mo'taqed budan) — \"to believe, to be convinced\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "من معتقدم که ورزش برای همه لازم است. man mo'taqedam ke varzesh barâye hame lâzem ast. I believe that sport is necessary for everyone."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Mo'taqed \"convinced\" + budan \"to be\": mo'taqedam ke … — I believe that …. A belief in something takes be: be chizi mo'taqed budan."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "معتقد is usually traced to Arabic mu'taqid \"believing, holding firmly\", from the same Arabic family as 'aqīda. Budan \"to be\" is the inherited Persian verb."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
